'''{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}''' [[File:Icon tab inf.png|20x20px]] is the 1st major reset layer in Revolution Idle, and is the 3rd reset layer overall. Upon reaching 1.79e308 Score, an option to Infinite for Infinity Points (IP) will be displayed. Upon claiming IP, an Infinity is performed and the following stats are reset:

# Current Score
# Colors and their Ascensions
# Prestige Mult and Exponent
# Promotion Levels
# Generator Power (Generator Amount is set back to their bought amounts instead)
# Stardust Amount

IP can be spent on Infinity Upgrades, Generators, Stars and Star Upgrades.

